@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About — ValIO</PageTitle>

<MudText Typo="Typo.h4" GutterBottom="true">About ValIO</MudText>
<MudText>
    ValIO is an open-source OpenAPI code generator. It takes an OpenAPI 3.x schema
    (JSON or YAML) and emits idiomatic clients, DTOs, and optional validation schemas
    for a growing list of languages and ecosystems.
</MudText>
<MudText Class="mt-4">
    See the <MudLink Href="/generate">Generate</MudLink> page to try it from your browser.
</MudText>
